            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bullet Candy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast hordes of enemies, dodge swarms of bullets and save the last humans in this explosive Twin Stick Shmup! Self-Destruct to cheat death and preserve your power-ups to become Bullet Hell! Tight score attack play, fast combat and online Leaderboards leave you needing just one more go! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/6600/extras/478c7385cde2f939e45f971eb89d6905.poster.avif?t=1790929002\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/6600/extras/478c7385cde2f939e45f971eb89d6905.webm?t=1790929002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/6600/extras/478c7385cde2f939e45f971eb89d6905.mp4?t=1790929002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >20th Anniversary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet Candy collects together 20 years of different versions, spin-offs, bonus games, prototypes, remakes and modern play modes all in one package. Ranging from a pre-release prototype, the original 2007 Steam release, a web spin off re-imagined with new visual effects, a new gameplay mode for 2026 AND MORE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/6600/extras/7559edc97884f971fc1df2aa231d6d03.poster.avif?t=1790929002\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/6600/extras/7559edc97884f971fc1df2aa231d6d03.webm?t=1790929002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/6600/extras/7559edc97884f971fc1df2aa231d6d03.mp4?t=1790929002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tFast, fun and frantic twin stick action! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tMultiple game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tFull Controller Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tSteam Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tNow on Linux/SteamOS and MacOS!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tPlays Great on Steam Deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/6600/extras/c00e1041bf275753140cc82d2a8a7ba3.poster.avif?t=1790929002\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/6600/extras/c00e1041bf275753140cc82d2a8a7ba3.webm?t=1790929002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/6600/extras/c00e1041bf275753140cc82d2a8a7ba3.mp4?t=1790929002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
