ts/steam/apps/6600/extras/7559edc97884f971fc1df2aa231d6d03.mp4?t=1790929002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tFast, fun and frantic twin stick action! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tMultiple game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tFull Controller Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tSteam Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tNow on Linux/SteamOS and MacOS!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tPlays Great on Steam Deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/6600/extras/c00e1041bf275753140cc82d2a8a7ba3.poster.avif?t=1790929002\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/6600/extras/c00e1041bf275753140cc82d2a8a7ba3.webm?t=1790929002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/6600/extras/c00e1041bf275753140cc82d2a8a7ba3.mp4?t=1790929002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
