                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "There's not a lot of games where the dev is there and comes back about two decades later with a full rebuild. If any of you had issues with this game, check the beta, or give it a few and check back. Between this, Terraria, and Vital Shell I'm starting to feel like I can't trust the calendar. What year is it?\r\n\r\nLatest beta has Linux support, rebuilds and sub-builds of older variants (2007, 2013, 2026, mini, and some assorted others like Gauntlet.). If you own the game and want some eye candy, give it another look. Want an old fashioned shameless arcade point-mongering and more colors than your body has room for? Give it a look.\r\n\r\nFor all the times you say, \"Cheers,\" Charlie - Cheers right back at you.",
